# Vendored OpenKB source and the superseded v3 corpus. Kept locally as the
# compiler's provenance and its parity benchmark, but not published: v3 looks
# like the live wiki and would invite citation of a superseded corpus, and
# republishing a whole third-party tree is not what the Apache-2.0 attribution
# in LICENSE requires. Restore from the previous generation's checkout to
# re-run the parity protocol in DESIGN.md.
reference/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
/docs/superpowers/
# Local planning artifacts: html-artifact pages and their diagram sources
# (CLAUDE.md). docs/agentic-workflow.html is published documentation.
/docs/drafts/
/docs/**/*.html
/docs/**/*.excalidraw
!/docs/agentic-workflow.html
/.agentic/
# Personal worktree hook for Orca and T3 Code; lives only in the main checkout.
/t3.json
/scripts/worktree-setup.sh

